{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24420","headline":"早夏晓兴赠梦得 · 白居易","name":"早夏晓兴赠梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窗明帘薄透朝光，卧整巾簪起下牀。\n背壁灯残经宿焰，开箱衣带隔年香。\n无情亦任他春去，不醉争销得昼长。\n一部清商一壶酒，与君明日暖新堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}